  "body": "Ask syweb where the web client is, rather than just presuming it's under `.__file__`. That way,  the debian package can declare that actually it lives in a different place, because debian packaging requires that the javascript lives in `/usr/share/javascript/...`.\n\n(This does first depend on a later release of matrix-angular-sdk; see [SYWEB-381](https://matrix.org/jira/browse/SYWEB-381))\n\n(Imported from https://matrix.org/jira/browse/SYN-443)\n\n(Reported by @leonerd)",
